    ],
    "display_heading": "The Jeffreys Prior"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Jeffreys (1961) proposed a general prior based on the Fisher information information, I, of the likelihood. Recall (LW Appendix 4) that $$ I(\\theta\\mid\\mathbf{x})=-E\\left[\\frac{\\partial^{2}\\ln\\ell(\\theta\\mid\\mathbf{x})}{\\partial\\theta^{2}}\\right] $$",
      "source_page": 1197,
      "source_pages": [
        1197
      ],
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Evolution_appendix2:p009:b8",
        "Evolution_appendix2:p009:b9",
        "Evolution_appendix2:p009:b10"
      ],
      "source_bboxes": [
        [
          134.0,
          1217.0,
          298.0,
          1240.0
        ],
        [
          132.0,
          1246.0,
          903.0,
          1294.0
        ],
        [
          393.0,
          1312.0,
          639.0,
          1366.0
        ]
      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "3f645866705fe8c5370c2219fde16b8d3583f62852883156cd95134d9c6b1ea8"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The Jeffreys prior is as follows: $$ p(\\theta)\\propto\\sqrt{I(\\theta\\mid\\mathbf{x})} $$",
      "source_page": 1197,
      "source_pages": [
        1197
      ],
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Evolution_appendix2:p009:b11",
        "Evolution_appendix2:p009:b12"
      ],
      "source_bboxes": [
        [
          133.0,
          1383.0,
          409.0,
          1408.0
        ],
        [
          444.0,
          1407.0,
          592.0,
          1435.0
        ]
      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "a5db5e1d6725a68af6e449bf5dddeb394ee50e74a5c90c4b721b6f0a26bac5f0"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "A full discussion, with derivation, can be found in Lee (2012).",
      "source_page": 1197,
      "source_pages": [
        1197
      ],
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Evolution_appendix2:p009:b14"
      ],
      "source_bboxes": [
        [
          133.0,
          1444.0,
          661.0,
          1469.0
        ]
      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "149f82c1e19b9db491010ee12883afe2edc3a8cfbc103c1a646d1ea3be2d14f5"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "When there are $ k $ parameters, I is the $ k \\times k $ Fisher information matrix of the expected second partials, where the elements of I are calculated by $$ \\mathbf{I}(\\boldsymbol{\\Theta}|\\mathbf{x})_{i j}=-E_{x}\\left[\\frac{\\partial^{2}\\ln\\ell(\\boldsymbol{\\Theta}|\\mathbf{x})}{\\partial\\theta_{i}\\partial\\theta_{j}}\\right] $$",
      "source_page": 1198,
      "source_pages": [
        1198
      ],
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Evolution_appendix2:p010:b2",
        "Evolution_appendix2:p010:b3"
      ],
      "source_bboxes": [
        [
          287.0,
          206.0,
          1058.0,
          255.0
        ],
        [
          528.0,
          272.0,
          814.0,
          325.0
        ]
      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "44d90653f22f54ac47f2eea2c22c9abaeb529ca2a4e33b840a7b57c3dc15dbb8"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "In this case, the Jeffreys prior becomes $$ p(\\boldsymbol{\\Theta})\\propto\\sqrt{\\det[\\mathbf{I}(\\boldsymbol{\\theta}\\mid\\mathbf{x})]} $$",
      "source_page": 1198,
      "source_pages": [
        1198
      ],
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Evolution_appendix2:p010:b4",
        "Evolution_appendix2:p010:b5"
      ],
      "source_bboxes": [
        [
